      "message": "feat(app): an MCP repair_model tool welds and closes an imported mesh (#717)\n\nrepair_model { name, weld_tol?, max_hole_edges? } runs the Model page's\nRepairModel command through the document History (one undo step that\nrestores the exact previous facets), with the GUI's defaults of 0.001 mm and\n256 edges. The reply carries the RepairReport's counts and summary line;\nevery refusal is the command's own text, and none enters the history.\n\nPinned by two new tests in crates/app/tests/mcp_model.rs on an open-top box\nSTL. Stacked on #716 (same module and test file).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
